047B84             0001*   ; =============================================================================
047B84             0002*   ; Stable Pingo terrain slots for the reusable-manager survey fixture.
047B84             0003*   ;
047B84             0004*   ; The fixture reserves the complete radius-five axial hex disk, but
047B84             0005*   ; every slot starts inactive.  Runtime-patched packets keep mesh and object
047B84             0006*   ; identifiers genuinely 16-bit; the setup loop must not silently become an
047B84             0007*   ; eight-bit-ID implementation merely because this first pool begins at one.
047B84             0008*   ; Command 50 can subsequently replace each placeholder mesh atomically.
047B84             0009*   ; =============================================================================
047B84             0010*   
047B84             0011*       MACRO MANAGER_SCENE_STORE_U16_HL ADDRESS
047B84             0012*           ld a,l
