06039A             2190*   
06039A             2191*   ; Normalize the mutable camera position into the manager's proposed axial
06039A             2192*   ; origin.  IX is opaque to the manager but is the fixture's p3d camera state
06039A             2193*   ; here.  The closed hex has Pingo-local corners
06039A             2194*   ;
06039A             2195*   ;   (x,z) = (0,-5120),(4400,-2560),(4400,2560),
06039A             2196*   ;           (0,5120),(-4400,2560),(-4400,-2560).
06039A             2197*   ;
06039A             2198*   ; Hence the sloped half-plane witness is exactly
06039A             2199*   ;
06039A             2200*   ;   1024*abs(x) + 1760*abs(z) <= 9,011,200.
06039A             2201*   ;
06039A             2202*   ; Both (0,5120) and (4400,2560) evaluate to 9,011,200.  Rebase does not occur
06039A             2203*   ; on that ownership boundary.  The current origin retains a fixed 256-count
06039A             2204*   ; (16 m) outward band.  For each sloped edge the exact integer witness is
06039A             2205*   ;
06039A             2206*   ;   round(256*sqrt(1024^2+1760^2)) = 521,271,
06039A             2207*   ;   retained half-plane RHS = 9,532,471.
06039A             2208*   ;
06039A             2209*   ; The expanded vertical and tip quick bounds are respectively 4,656 and
06039A             2210*   ; 5,376 counts.  Exact outer-limit ties retain the current origin; the first
06039A             2211*   ; integer beyond a limit selects a neighbor.  The branch order below gives
06039A             2212*   ; corners a deterministic vertical-before-sloped tie rule.  After a rebase,
06039A             2213*   ; applying the same expanded hex around the new origin supplies the symmetric
06039A             2214*   ; deadband, so boundary jitter cannot immediately select the old origin.
06039A             2215*   ; Axis checks reduce arbitrarily displaced signed-word inputs before the
06039A             2216*   ; multiplication, so each unsigned product and sum fits in 24 bits.
06039A             2217*   terrain_provider_normalize_position:
06039A FD E5       2218*       push iy
06039C             2219*   .if terrain_manager_group_staging
06039C CD 04 F9 05 2220*       call terrain_provider_transition_busy
0603A0 B7          2221*       or a
0603A1 28 04       2222*       jr z,@transition_idle
0603A3 FD E1       2223*       pop iy
0603A5 B7          2224*       or a
